        <headline>Coastal Flood Advisory issued September 26 at 1:45AM EDT until September 26 at 10:00AM EDT by NWS Wilmington NC</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Up to one foot of inundation above ground level
expected in low-lying areas near shorelines and tidal
waterways.

* WHERE...Coastal Brunswick County.

* WHEN...From 6 AM to 10 AM EDT this morning.

* IMPACTS...Low-lying roads and locations along the Intracoastal
Waterway and adjacent tidal creeks may observe minor coastal
flooding. Check with local officials for any road closures or
impacts.
</description>
        <instruction>Do not drive around barricades or through water of unknown depth.
Take the necessary actions to protect flood-prone property.</instruction>
